  "reflectionText": "The younger son left. The elder son stayed. The father went out to both of them — once down the road, once into the yard.\n\nThe younger son began his rehearsed speech. The father called for the robe, the ring, the sandals, the calf.\n\nThe music played inside the house. The elder son stood outside the door."
